#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/advanced_replace.rst:5
msgid "Advanced replace"
msgstr "高级替换"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/advanced_replace.rst:7
msgid ""
"QElectroTech provides the possibility to define a string and replace if for "
"a new defining some conditions:"
msgstr "QElectroTech 允许定义字符串，并在满足某些条件时将其替换为新字符串："

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/advanced_replace.rst:9
msgid "Type of object."
msgstr "对象类型。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/advanced_replace.rst:10
msgid "Object property with the defined value."
msgstr "具有指定值的对象属性。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/advanced_replace.rst:11
msgid "Filtering `folio`_, `type of element`_, etc."
msgstr "过滤 `图幅 <folio_>`_ 、`元件类型 <type of element_>`_ 等。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/advanced_replace.rst:15
msgid ""
"If the `search menu`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from **Edit > "
"Search / Replace** menu item."
msgstr "如果 `搜索菜单 <search menu_>`_ 未显示，可通过 **编辑 > 搜索/替换** 菜单项将其显示出来。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/advanced_replace.rst:19
msgid "To replace text information from project objects:"
msgstr "要替换项目对象中的文本信息："

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/advanced_replace.rst:21
msgid "Press **advanced** button to display advanced replace PopUp window."
msgstr "按 **高级** 按钮显示高级替换弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/advanced_replace.rst:22
msgid ""
"Define QElectroTech object type from **Who** combobox (Ex.: `Element`_)."
msgstr "从 **Who** 组合框中选择 QElectroTech 对象类型（例如：`Element`_ ）。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/advanced_replace.rst:27
#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/advanced_replace.rst:34
#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/advanced_replace.rst:42
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech advanced replace PopUp window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 高级替换弹出窗口"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/advanced_replace.rst:29
msgid ""
"Define object property type from **What** combobox (Ex.: Manufacturer)."
msgstr "从 **What** 组合框中选择对象属性类型（例如：Manufacturer）。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/advanced_replace.rst:36
msgid ""
"Define the property value which should be replaced in the **Replace** text "
"box (Ex.: SIEMENS)."
msgstr "在 **Replace** 文本框中定义要替换的属性值（例如：SIEMENS）。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/advanced_replace.rst:37
msgid ""
"Define the new property value at the replace text box in the **By** text box"
" (Ex.: SCHNEIDER)."
msgstr "在 **By** 文本框中定义新的属性值（例如：SCHNEIDER）。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/advanced_replace.rst:44
msgid "Press **OK** button to storage the desired replacing conditions."
msgstr "按 **OK** 按钮保存所需的替换条件。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/advanced_replace.rst:45
msgid ""
"Filter in the object tree the `folios`_ where the action should be applied."
msgstr "在对象树中筛选出要应用该操作的 `图幅 <folios_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/advanced_replace.rst:50
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech search menu element properties PopUP window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 搜索菜单元件属性弹出窗口"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/advanced_replace.rst:52
msgid "Press **Replace all** button to apply the replace action."
msgstr "按 **替换全部** 按钮应用替换操作。"
